            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To Imperator Caesar Gaius Vibius Afinius Gallus Veldumnianus Volusianus Pius Felix Augustus, with tribunician power for the 2nd time, consul, father of the fatherland. The [people of] Comenses are most devoted to his numen and majesty.</p>
